+/* Reverse map: which virtual page each frame currently holds.  Without it,
+ * reusing a frame leaves the previous virtual page's L2 entry pointing at
+ * memory that now belongs to a different page -- fine for a single forward
+ * sweep (which is how the self-test ran) and fatal for real code that
