+/****************************************************************************
+ * boards/arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/khicas/khicas_app.cpp
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+ *
+ * KhiCAS on the HP 39gII: the resident half of the application.
+ *
+ * The giac engine is ~3 MB of code and does not fit in the 512 KB of SRAM,
+ * so it is linked into the paged window (see the .pgtext section in the
+ * linker script) and demand-paged from a blob on NAND by
+ * stmp3770_pagefault().  Everything in this file is small enough to stay
+ * resident, and it also supplies the platform functions the engine expects
+ * (display, keyboard, clock, files) plus a text REPL on the LCD console.
+ *
+ ****************************************************************************/
+
