+
+/* Board helper (hp39gii_boot.c): 1 = blob present, 0 = NAND erased,
+ * negative = NAND not ready.  Kept on the C side so this file needs no
+ * NuttX headers, which do not coexist with the newlib headers that the
+ * prebuilt C++ runtime expects.
